{{/*
Weather bulletin example. Exercises the full pica template
surface: wrap/justify/truncl (width-parameterized layout), the
value formatters, and .table blocks at the default and an
explicit width. Rendered with:

    pica render -txtar page.tmpl content.txtar

The txtar archive supplies data.yaml (structured fields),
body.txt (the synopsis prose, injected as .body) and sources.txt
(injected as .sources).
*/ -}}
LIMASSOL WEATHER BULLETIN
{{shortDate .issued}} {{shortTime .issued}} · issue {{.issue}}

# Synopsis

{{wrap 40 .body}}

# Now ({{shortTime .current.observed}})

Temp      {{decimal .current.temp 1}} C ({{round .current.feels}} C feels)
Humidity  {{round .current.humidity}}%
Pressure  {{decimal .current.pressure 1}} hPa
Wind      {{pad .current.winddir 3}} {{round .current.windkt}} kt
Sunshine  {{dur .current.sunshine}} since dawn

Raw METAR (cut to page width):
{{truncl 40 .metar}}

# 5-day Forecast

.table 6L *L 4R 4R 5R
Day | Conditions | Hi | Lo | Rain
{{range .daily}}{{shortDate .date}} | {{.summary}} | {{round .hi}} | {{round .lo}} | {{round .rain}}%
{{end}}.end

# Sea (compact, 28-column box)

.table 28 9L 6R *R
Water | Temp | Waves
{{range .sea}}{{.spot}} | {{decimal .temp 1}} C | {{.wave}}
{{end}}.end

# Outlook

{{justify 40 .outlook}}

Sources:
{{range .sources}}  {{trunc . 38}}
{{end}}